# Agent Workflow Constraints

## Root-cause first, no speculative fixes

- Do not loosen checks, add fallbacks, or broaden accepted conditions to mask an error when the root cause is unclear.
- If unsure, stop and discuss with the user before changing behavior.
- Prefer failing fast with a clear diagnosis over silently allowing unknown conditions to pass.

## Confirm before resource-heavy operations

- Before starting builds, long test runs, large downloads, or other time/resource-intensive actions, ask the user for confirmation first.
- Do not start such operations on your own initiative without explicit approval.
